<ContentLayout title="Stadium POS — Pascal Krebs" backHref="/projects" backLabel="Projects">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight mb-2">Stadium POS System</h1>
  <p class="text-grey text-sm mb-8">2018 · Builds</p>

  <p class="mb-4">The first thing I ever built.</p>

  <p class="mb-4">A point-of-sale system for stadium vendors — the people walking the stands with beer and food. Before it, they calculated every price by hand. Under time pressure, with a crowd in front of them. That's stressful, it's slow, and it goes wrong.</p>

  <p class="mb-4">The system was about trust and quality management — the vendor knows the number is right, and so does the person paying. On top of that it saved hours per event that had been going into mental arithmetic.</p>

  <p class="text-grey mt-10">More details coming soon.</p>
</ContentLayout>
